<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head">Head for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>With the addition of Protocol Inferno Heroic Dungeons it's now possible to purchase the 379 item level <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60237/crown-of-the-twilight-queen">
<img alt="Crown of the Twilight Queen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Twilight Queen</span></a> best in slot headpiece from phase 1 and 2, this is an insane early item to get as it's similar item level to even the phase 3 content.<br/>
<br/>Otherwise, using the engineering head is recommended since it's very easy to craft and available from the best in slot profession anyways.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62367/arcanum-of-hyjal">
<img alt="Arcanum of Hyjal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Hyjal</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1158/guardians-of-hyjal">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Guardians of Hyjal</span></a>.</div></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
