<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands">Hands for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Although the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71286/firehawk-gloves">
<img alt="Firehawk Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_robe_raidmage_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firehawk Gloves</span></a> are available from the valor vendor, and you'll likely end up using them temporarily later on regardless - focusing on the chest and legs first using <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is recommended, and instead use the tier 11 gloves on this slot for the 2-piece set bonus with the tier 11 shoulders.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
