<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist">Waist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>The heroic version of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63498/soul-breath-belt">
