<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs">Legs for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Similarly to the chest and hands slot, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71288/firehawk-leggings">
