<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Frost Mage DPS Phase 3 Pre-Raid</h4>Althought not as high priority as tier 12 items, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71213/amulet-of-burning-brilliance">
<img alt="Amulet of Burning Brilliance" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of Burning Brilliance</span></a> <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> is a great purchase to get caught up with other players. <br/>
<br/>Until you're able to buy it, either of the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65373/planetary-band">
<img alt="Planetary Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Planetary Band</span></a> listed below is fine to use since they'll provide close enough performance for very cheap cost, basically 1 dungeon worth of the new currency that drops from bosses in heroic protocol inferno dungeons.<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
